<title>UK: LME copper ends AM kerb firmer, off highs.</title>
<headline>LME copper ends AM kerb firmer, off highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Ends AM kerb firmer at $2,514 but off earlier highs. Cash/threes spread little changed at $67/8 backwardation.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Slightly weaker, but above $1,630.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Sheds nearly all rebound gains, returns to $7,300 area.</p>
<p>TIN  - Slightly easier, slips under $5,700. OTHERS - Unchanged.</p>
</text>
